      "whyItMatters": "In enterprise production environments, failure to master evaluate tradeo\ufb00s between custom solutions, managed services, pre-trained models, and fms to meet business needs. results in critical vulnerabilities: train-serve skew, silent accuracy decay, runaway GPU bills, or severe data compliance violations. Mastering this topic ensures high-throughput, fault-tolerant, and audit-compliant machine learning systems.",
