    "scenarioTip": "Use SageMaker Distributed Data Parallel (SMDDP) with ring-AllReduce for large computer vision/NLP datasets; use Amazon Bedrock LoRA/PEFT with JSONL prompt-response pairs for fine-tuning Foundation Models."
