      "Understand how AWS integrates Amazon SageMaker Pipelines and related services for Task 3.3: Implement automated orchestration and continuous CI/CD pipelines.",
      "Learn the step-by-step technical lifecycle, data path, and runtime mechanics of this workflow.",
