        "Step 3 (Pipeline Integration): Connect Amazon Personalize to upstream data streams, feature stores, or downstream inference endpoints.",
        "Step 4 (Observability): Configure Amazon CloudWatch alarms on key operational metrics and enable AWS CloudTrail API logging.",
        "Step 5 (Cost & Scale): Implement Auto-Scaling policies or lifecycle transition rules to optimize ongoing cloud spend."
