      "whyItMatters": "Leveraging Amazon SageMaker AI eliminates the substantial operational overhead, patching, and scaling risks of maintaining custom open-source tools. It natively integrates with AWS IAM, CloudWatch, and AWS KMS, ensuring enterprise security compliance out of the box.",
