      "mechanics": "AWS CloudTrail communicates with other AWS services via encrypted HTTPS REST APIs signed with AWS Signature Version 4 (SigV4). Data at rest is secured using AWS KMS Customer Managed Keys (CMKs) with envelope encryption. Network traffic remains entirely within the AWS internal backbone when accessed via VPC Endpoints (AWS PrivateLink)."
